== Trivia ==
* This is a reference to the [http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=3 iconic card of the same name] from [[wikipedia:Magic: the Gathering|Magic: the Gathering]], a [[wikipedia:collectible card game|collectible card game]] [[Edmund McMillen]] played since his childhood.
** Its powerful effect of producing three [https://mtg.wiki/page/Mana Mana] of any color is reflected by the ingame item's effect of adding three hearts of different colors to the player's health.
** The fact that it's one of the rarest and most expensive commercially released cards in the game might also be referenced by the fact that it's a relatively hard item to come across, being only a rare find exclusively in {{R|Secret Room}}s.

